      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Lillian Elliott (24 April 1874 – 15 January 1959) was a stage and film actress, appearing in 60 films between 1915 and 1943. She was born in Canada and died in Hollywood, California. She was married to actor James Corrigan, and their son, Lloyd Corrigan, became a Hollywood writer, director, and character actor.",
      "depth": 0,
